<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μενοεικής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκός, ἔοικα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>suited to the desires, satisfying, agreeable, to
				one's taste</i>, mostly of meat and drink, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαίς, δεῖπνον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.391
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδωδή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.76
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον καὶ ὕδωρ καὶ οἶνον . . ἐνθήσω
					μενοεικἔ, ἅ κέν τοι λιμὸν ἐρύκοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					5.166
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρα γὰρ μενοεικέα πολλὰ δαίνυσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.227
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				16.429
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐξαιρεύμην μενοεικέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.232
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφος μ.</span> a
			<i>plentiful</i> funeral feast, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μενοεικέα ὕλην</span>
			<i>great store of</i> wood, ib.<i><span class="en">
				139
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶρα,] χάρις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				19.144
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.650
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καί σφιν μενοεικέα ληΐδα δῶκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.273
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Phoc.</u>
				2
			</span></i>.</div>
